{190}{Him and his friend, Fahrkus, I believe his name was, came to my house looking for sustenance, or so they said. After I fed them they terrorized me and my family and ransacked my house for whatever they could find. When they finally found my one object of any value, a sacred, holy artifact, they...killed my family. They left me for dead, as well...}{Him and his friend,Fahrkus, I believe his name was, came to my house looking for sustenance, or so they said. After I fed them they terrorized me and my family and ransacked my house for whatever they could find. When they finally found my one object of any value, a sacred, holy artifact, they...killed my family. They left me for dead, as well...}{}{}{}{gf2644 1 }
