{200}{My family was brutally slaughtered by two madmen, Brehgo and Fahrkus, I believe their names were. I was left for dead. I welcomed them into my house, offered them sustenance, and they repaid me by  killing my wife and children and stealing the only thing I had of any value, a sacred religious artifact.}{My family was brutally slaughtered by two madmen, Brehgo and Fahrkus, I believe their names were. I was left for dead. I welcomed them into my house, offered them sustenance, and they repaid me by  killing my wife and children and stealing the only thing I had of any value, a sacred religious artifact.}{}{}{}{gf2644 1 }
